Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["State vectors, initial conditions, and equations", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"de9be5d9-8061-42d7-958a-0506aa704040"],

Cell["\<\
Construct species abundances plus the shared and local nutrient pools, then \
assemble one symbolic equation template. The scenario builder activates alpha \
and cumulative Delta1 through Delta5 combinations without duplicating or \
changing the underlying equations.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"681d911c-81f6-46ab-86df-0e607ab07693"],

